{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先ほど、熊本県で大きな地震がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても心配しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細はまだわかりませんが、\n余震もまだ続いているということなので\n皆様が無事でいらっしゃることを\n願っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、靴下が真っ黒になるまで\n練習しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいろいろ考えました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ黒になっていく靴下をみて\n周りを見て、自分のことをみて\nいろいろ考えて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくも本格始動し\nアンダーライブも最終追い込みにはいり\n2つのことを同時進行に行うことが\n不得意なので、\nぐしゃぐしゃになってますが\n頑張ると決めたので頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も冒頭あいさつ、終わりのあいさつ\nヒナコセレクト(仮)はやりません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からまた再開します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またあした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/14/4594825/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}